   ans:"(1) <b>Vital signs</b> — ไข้ (SBP), BP/PR (sepsis, bleeding) · (2) <b>Consciousness + asterixis (flapping tremor)</b> — hepatic encephalopathy · (3) <b>Jaundice</b> (sclera) · (4) <b>Pallor</b> · (5) <b>Parotid gland enlargement</b> (alcohol) · (6) <b>Spider nevi, palmar erythema</b>, leukonychia, clubbing, Dupuytren contracture · (7) <b>Gynecomastia</b>, loss of axillary/body hair, <b>testicular atrophy</b> · (8) <b>JVP</b> และหัวใจ (แยก cardiac ascites — constrictive pericarditis, right HF) · (9) <b>Abdomen — ascites</b>: bulging flanks, <b>shifting dullness</b>, <b>fluid thrill</b> · (10) <b>Liver</b> (ขนาด ขอบ ผิว — โตหรือฝ่อ, nodular, tenderness) และ <b>splenomegaly / splenic dullness</b> · (11) <b>Caput medusae</b>, umbilical hernia · (12) กดเจ็บ/rebound (peritonitis) · (13) <b>Pitting edema</b>, muscle wasting · (14) ปอด: pleural effusion (hepatic hydrothorax) · (15) bruising/petechiae",
